*** Keywords ***

TC CB010513-D-TC-1
    [Documentation]
    ...     Conditions:     8940-I & G activated
    ...     Actions:        Cell setup & call setup with 3 UEs (UE 1 1200mbps, UE 2 1200mbps)
    ...     Checks:         PM counters check : value as expected
    ...     Verdict:        PM counters value check as expected
    [Arguments]             ${param}
    ...                     ${vendor_custom}


    Init Sequence           ${param}
    Step                    Set RAD Params Of CB010513-D
    Step                    Deploy Vendor File Config               vendor_param=${vendor_custom}        is_perform_full_commissioning=${false}
    Dated Log New Line      ${vendor_custom}
    Critical Step           CB010513-D-Keywords.Perform Recommissionning  #Perform Recommissionning
    Critical Step           Restart TL
    Step                    Multi Cells Setup CB010513 D                argument=${param.nbCell}
    Step                    SA Call DL Traffic With UE Profile      argument=${Profile_UE_MIMO_1}
    Step                    sleep    2s
    Step                    SA Call DL Traffic With UE Profile      argument=${Profile_UE_MIMO_2}
    Step                    sleep    2s
    Step                    Activate Sherpa On All Cells
    Step                    sleep    10s
    Step                    Stop Sherpa Collection
    Step                    sleep    360s
    Step                    Collect Lastest PM Counters File
    Step                    Check CB010513 D PM Counters
    Step                    Compare CB010513 D PM Counters


Suite Setup CB010513-D
    [Documentation]
    ...     Conditions:     customs configurations yamlPathname
    ...     Actions:        it performs the generic suite setup and backup the configurations files
    ...     Checks:         it checks nothing more than already done on lib.
    ...     Verdict:        suite setup is passed
    #Setup.Suite Setup From Scratch    keepAllUeDataInCfgFile=${True}        automaticTeardown=${True}
    [Arguments]             ${yamlPathname}=${EMPTY}

    Setup.Suite Setup from scratch        yamlPathname=${yamlPathname}
    ...                                   listBackupFiles=${FD_ALL}
    ...                                   keepAllUeDataInCfgFile=${True}
    Backup Files
    ${scf_suite_setup_backup}         OAM Get SCF File    file=SCF_Suite_Setup_Backup.xml
    Set Suite Variable      ${scf_suite_setup_backup}
    Dated Log               SCF backup file = ${scf_suite_setup_backup}

Perform Recommissionning
    Oam.OAM Perform Full Commissioning  scf_file=${SCF_SETUP_PATH}
    WA Airscale Wait for Ready    ${GNB_DU}

Set RAD Params Of CB010513-D
   [Documentation]     Add or Modify the RAD params of 8940 To Activate the feature
    ...                 will be replaced later by NIDD params
    ...                 0x580117=1 : #CSI-RS Event Sherpa
    ...                 0x58012B=1 : Canada Frame Struct
    ...                 0x58070a=1 : 10513-E rdCellCsiRsPeriodicityBbPoolExtensionTddFr1, for L2PS
    ...                 0x5901dd=1 : 10513-F rdCprt for L3
    Dated Log New Line   Add RAD params of 8940-F InterL1SubPool and ZeroAllocationByPass are Disabled ......
    ${rad_param_1}=      create dictionary       field=0x58075b   value=1
    ${rad_param_list}=       Create List         ${rad_param_1}
    Dated Log New Line    RAD params :  ${rad_param_list}
    SetConfig.Set Fields in swconfig DU       param_list=${rad_param_list}
    Dated Log New Line   RAD params of 10513-F update completed


Multi Cells Setup CB010513 D
    [Arguments]       ${nbCell}
    ${msgStr}=    Catenate  Test ${nbCell} Cells Setup
    Dated Log   ${msgStr}
    Setup Wtsemu SA
    sleep    60s
    WTS Set X2 Link
    sleep    5s

Check CB010513 D PM Counters
    Check CB010513 D PM Counter1 Expected Values      ${Num of PRBs for 2 UE pair tx for MU MIMO in DL}
    Check CB010513 D PM Counter2 Expected Values      ${Number of PRBs for 8-layer Tx for MU MIMO in DL}




Check CB010513 D PM Counter1 Expected values
    [Documentation]                 To Check CB010513 D PM counter values are as exepected
    [Arguments]                     ${PM_Counters_Expected}
    Dated Log                       =======================================================================
    Dated Log                       PM counter : ${PM_Counters_Expected.PM_ID}
    Dated Log                       --------------------------------------------------------------------------------
    ${Value_PM_Counter1_Cell_1}=            Counters.Retrieve Latest Single Counter Value From Pm File with CellID
    ...                                    ${LATEST_PM_FILE}       ${PM_Counters_Expected.PM_ID}       ${NRCELLID_1_idx}
    Dated Log                         Value of PM counter : ${PM_Counters_Expected.PM_ID} : cell : ${NRCELLID_1_idx} : ${Value_PM_Counter1_Cell_1}
    Set Suite Variable              ${Value_PM_Counter1_Cell_1}

Check CB010513 D PM Counter2 Expected values
    [Documentation]                 To Check CB010513 F PM counter values are as exepected
    [Arguments]                     ${PM_Counters_Expected}
    Dated Log                       =======================================================================
    Dated Log                       PM counter : ${PM_Counters_Expected.PM_ID}
    Dated Log                       --------------------------------------------------------------------------------
    ${Value_PM_Counter2_Cell_1}=            Counters.Retrieve Latest Single Counter Value From Pm File with CellID
    ...                                    ${LATEST_PM_FILE}       ${PM_Counters_Expected.PM_ID}       ${NRCELLID_1_idx}
    Dated Log                         Value of PM counter : ${PM_Counters_Expected.PM_ID} : cell : ${NRCELLID_1_idx} : ${Value_PM_Counter2_Cell_1}
    Set Suite Variable              ${Value_PM_Counter2_Cell_1}


Compare CB010513 D PM Counters

    Dated Log      ${Value_PM_Counter1_Cell_1}
    Dated Log      ${Value_PM_Counter2_Cell_1}


    Should Be True      ${Value_PM_Counter1_Cell_1} == ${Value_PM_Counter2_Cell_1}

    Dated Log New Line   Test of CB010513-D completed

End Of TC
   [Documentation]        At the end of each TC :
   ...                      - show the Diagnosis of the TC steps
   ...                      - collect the gnb Snapshot
   ...                      - if TC failed, collect also AP sosReport

   Dated Log              End Of TC : start
   Produce Scout Data
   Oam.OAM Get Snapshot
   Run Keyword If Test Failed     Setup.Get Sos Report
   GenericTest.Display Diagnosis
   Dated Log              End of TC : end
